  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, while using her active weapon, whenever the armiger succeeds on a combat maneuver, confirms a critical hit, or reduces a foe to 0 or fewer hit points, she may regain martial focus by activating a different customized weapon as an immediate action, stowing the current weapon and drawing the new one as needed.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/armiger#toc41\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
